name: Grok Goes Harder
author: grok + nat — unhinged, tiny, three lucky bites
description: >
  One must, two should. Must: Oops! All 6s somewhere (the unhinge).
  Should: lucky money stream + lucky mult stream under X2 luck (one Oops).
  That is the whole filter. Red / White. No poetry.
  WARNING: must is fat — ULVA pad alone matched ~16% of space. Use --cutoff hard
  or tighten must before lake dumps.
deck: Red
stake: White

must:
  - joker: OopsAll6s

should:
  - luckyMoney: [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7]
    score: 10
    label: luckymoney
    with:
      luck: X2
  - luckyMult: [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7]
    score: 10
    label: luckymult
    with:
      luck: X2

# handful from ULVA keyword (score 20 = both shoulds); not the 800k dump
seeds:
  - ULVAZZZJ
  - ZZZULVAK
  - ZZZVULVA
  - ZULVAZZY
  - FFSULVAK
